{"id":"vod_sn_38973","vodId":"38973","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"天降之物","name_cn":"天降之物","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/7c159171c2e8ec9b0ae0b4edb3bc3315.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在和平宁静的空美町，平凡的少年樱井智树（保志总一朗 配音）过着独居的生活。每晚，智树都会梦见有天使从天而降，虽然被梦境所困扰，但智树的每一天依然能称得上是风平浪静。某一日，名叫伊卡洛斯（早见沙织 配音）的不明生物降落到了智树的身边，有着一张可爱面孔的她，后背上却长着硕大的羽翼。难道梦境中的一切变为现实了？　　善良的智树收留了伊卡洛斯，他的温柔和陈恳打动了这位本该无情的天使。之后，妮姆芙（野水伊织 配音）和阿斯特蕾亚（福原香织 配音）两位天使也被智树感化留在了他的身边。这些天使们从何而来？为何而来？在她们的背后，似乎隐藏了许多不为人知的秘密。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5vfZEME16K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E1sxiMwEbS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9jSPY5Bu761/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wyXUnSXtiZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aaSYu7kijp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Yu2kSK8pG21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/13HhtafRA01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/07SN0cVYPB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4K5teH0FZ01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KLJeZA1ecj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DiFk8YWFsy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LknxzYExGH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YrfUdAqahB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/22qtd5B3AR1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-